 third component is the **streaming hierarchical generation engine**, which simultaneously produces streams of semantic tokens, acoustic tokens for both the user and Moshi, and time‑aligned text tokens for Moshi (when Inner Monologue is active), enabling full‑duplex, low‑latency spoken interaction [S2].", "reasoning_chars": 374}}
