h model, allowing Moshi to encode and decode acoustic information such as voice, emotion and environmental conditions [S2]. The third component is a streaming, hierarchical generation mechanism that jointly produces semantic tokens, acoustic tokens and, when using Inner Monologue, text tokens for both the user and Moshi, enabling real‑time, full‑duplex spoken dialogue [S2].", "reasoning_chars": 331}}
